From b5c712f4de991694633c4116fb9140aef4956458 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Knaox <djamvn@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 01:10:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: add moltenvk context rendering into a host
 CAMetalLayer

--gpu-context=moltenvk takes the CAMetalLayer pointer from --wid and
renders into it with no window of its own; --moltenvk-surface-size sets
the swapchain size (VOCTRL_EXTERNAL_RESIZE, like d3d11-composition-size).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
