index d8c11bd995..e9569e5fae 100644
--- a/DOCS/man/options.rst
+++ b/DOCS/man/options.rst
@@ -7136,6 +7136,14 @@ them.
 
     Windows with ``--gpu-context=d3d11`` and  ``--d3d11-output-mode=composition`` only.
 
+``--moltenvk-surface-size=<WxH>``
+    Size, in pixels, of the swapchain for ``--gpu-context=moltenvk``. There is
+    no window: the embedding application owns the ``CAMetalLayer`` passed with
+    ``--wid`` and must set its size. Without it, the layer's ``drawableSize`` is
+    used.
+
+    macOS with ``--gpu-context=moltenvk`` only.
+
 ``--gpu-sw``
     Continue even if a software renderer is detected. This only works with
     OpenGL/Vulkan backends. For d3d11, see ``--d3d11-warp``.
@@ -7186,6 +7194,10 @@ them.
         Android/EGL. Requires ``--wid`` be set to an ``android.view.Surface``.
     macvk
         Vulkan on macOS with a metal surface through a translation layer (experimental)
+    moltenvk
+        Vulkan on macOS (MoltenVK) into a ``CAMetalLayer`` owned by the
+        embedding application. Requires ``--wid`` be set to that layer; see
+        ``--moltenvk-surface-size``.
 
     This is an object settings list option. See `List Options`_ for details.
 
